.TH LL-BUILDER 1 "August 2026" "Linyaps 1.14.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ll-builder \- build and publish Linyaps applications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ll-builder
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ll-builder
creates, builds, imports, exports and publishes Linyaps application projects.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B create, build, clean
Create a project and manage its build output.
.TP
.B run, list, remove
Run and manage locally built applications.
.TP
.B import, extract, export, push
Move layers and universal application bundles between repositories or files.
.TP
.B repo
Manage builder repository configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.B \-\-help-all
Show help for all commands.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version information.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I linglong.yaml
Default project description.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ll-cli (1),
.BR ll-builder-export (1),
.BR ll-box (1)
